          "id": "8c849e787b03c727318230a25404a63a80de4817",
          "message": "Multilog consistent read optimizations (#1832)\n\n* add BDN to evaluate overhead of ConsistentRead\n\n* cache consistentRead switch\n\n* reduce collision by using the high order bits when accessing the sketch\n\n* eliminate TimeQueue contention by using inline timeout evaluation through passing the timeout directly through the method signature\n\n* implement a list of waiters and allow for a fixed number of spin waits\n\n* renaming and cleanup\n\n* propagate hash down to read\n\n* fix tsavorite formatting\n\n* fix build for BDN\n\n* avoid false sharing at sketchMaxValue; cache sketMaxValue at read side\n\n* track ongoing consistent read\n\n* implement replay side throttling\n\n* fix log messages\n\n* reset consistentReadActive = false\n\n* fix possible race\n\n* ensure complete pending is awaited before post single key callback executes\n\n* better logging",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-30T16:48:18-07:00",
          "tree_id": "54ae42f8d987ab9760cd40295ca1acdf70ed4035",
