          "id": "5fe6e372f94c70065186cb1879876b5b821386e8",
          "message": "Min 4k TKV log page size; revise device sector size setting; DefaultInitialIORecordSize overridable by operation, session, or store (#1853)\n\n* Keep AsyncGetFromDisk calling size to be under SectorSize unless specified otherwise, and clamp to end of page. Reduce IStreamBuffer.DefaultInitialIORecordSize to 32 and add ReadOptions and RMWOptions to add InitialIORecordSize to override this, and also add store-level and session-level overrides. Update local storage device variants to look for the max of logical and physical sector size.\n\n* Tweak for GetAndPopulateReadBuffer read length\n\n* Safekeeping checkin, mostly test conversion to support 4k sectors which is minimum for pagesize\n\n* Finish conversion of tests to use 4k pages, which will work with any device sector size up to 4k\n\n* Fixes so either 512b or 4kb sector sizes pass the tests\n\n* Fix perf regression for new multilevel InitialIOSize spec\n\n* Return GetDeviceSectorSize to use GetDiskFreeSpace and return MinDeviceSectorSize to 512b (which required fixing up some tests that were using MinDeviceSectorSize instead of MinKVPageSize)\n\n* format\n\n* Fix comment for default for Garnet InitialIORecordSize option\n\n* Address Copilot comments; restore previous version of GetDeviceSectorSize as GetVolumeSectorSize\n\n* Make WaitForFrameLoad rethrow OperationCanceledException\n\n* temporarily disable test that needs updating\n\n* Fix ObjectIterationPushLockTest\n\n* Fix ObjectIterationPushLockTests\n\n* Fix MultiDatabaseSaveInProgressTest\n\n* Add WaitUntilNextSecond() to handle LASTSAVE returning only second-level granularity, which caused intermittent hangs on the LASTSAVE loop testing if the BGSAVE was complete\n\n* format",
